{"words": [{"text": "ذَٰلِكَ", "translation": "That"}, {"text": "بِأَنَّ", "translation": "(is) because"}, {"text": "ٱللَّهَ", "translation": "Allah"}, {"text": "نَزَّلَ", "translation": "revealed"}, {"text": "ٱلْكِتَـٰبَ", "translation": "the Book"}, {"text": "بِٱلْحَقِّ ۗ", "translation": "with [the] Truth"}, {"text": "وَإِنَّ", "translation": "And indeed"}, {"text": "ٱلَّذِينَ", "translation": "those"}, {"text": "ٱخْتَلَفُوا۟", "translation": "who differed"}, {"text": "فِى", "translation": "in"}, {"text": "ٱلْكِتَـٰبِ", "translation": "the Book"}, {"text": "لَفِى", "translation": "(are) surely in"}, {"text": "شِقَاقٍۭ", "translation": "schism"}, {"text": "بَعِيدٍۢ", "translation": "far"}], "sahih": "That is [deserved by them] because Allāh has sent down the Book in truth. And indeed, those who differ over the Book are in extreme dissension."}